975
01:03:15.875 --> 01:03:17.333
Uh-huh. I'll be right there.

976
01:03:20.875 --> 01:03:21.875
Hmm.

977
01:03:23.583 --> 01:03:24.625
[Yazaki shudders]

978
01:03:26.333 --> 01:03:27.541
